{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27202","headline":"白云向空尽 · 焦郁","name":"白云向空尽","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白云昇远岫，摇曳入晴空。\n乘化随舒卷，无心任始终。\n欲销仍带日，将断更因风。\n势薄飞难定，天高色易穷。\n影收元气表，光灭太虚中。\n傥若从龙去，还施济物功。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"焦郁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27202.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27202","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}